From: ios-mh2lm
Subject: mh2lm: own shared mux and device startup at board level

Call late board initialization from BSD before root lookup. Keep UFS startup
storage-only, including its partition-backed persistent logger. Start the PMIC
mux independently of keys; keys and battery attach their own route groups.
Infrastructure readiness leaves upstream IRQ masked until a consumer attaches.
No change to charger policy, HID processing or USB/touch IRQ handlers.

